    <li>The <span style="color:var(--success);">East‑West Corridor</span> connects <span style="color:var(--warning);">Porbandar</span> to <span style="color:var(--warning);">Silchar</span>, spanning <span style="color:var(--warning);">3,300 km</span>.</li>
