    <li>Average area: <span style="color:var(--success);">≈ 400 sq km</span>, but extremes range from <span style="color:var(--success);">29 sq km (Keoladeo)</span> to <span style="color:var(--success);">1,100 sq km (Namdapha)</span>.</li>
